# Editor/agent temporary backups. These are stale copies of source files; if they
# get committed they pollute any "residual code" grep with code that no longer
# compiles (e.g. an old SuperMediaPlayer.cpp still containing deleted machinery).
*~RF*.TMP
*.TMP

