# Visual Studio (MSVC) related. `.vs/` is per-user IDE state (browse database,
# open-document list); `deploy_win.ps1` / `build_macos.sh` regenerate nothing
# from it, so committing it only adds churn and machine-specific paths.
.vs/
**/.vs/

